Package: scaffoldR
Type: Package
Title: Scaffold New R Research Projects
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Franco", "Edwardes",
    email = "franco.edwardes@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Creates new R projects with a standardised directory structure,
    Git initialisation, optional renv setup, and optional remote configuration
    (GitHub or arbitrary URL). Call scaffoldR::scaffold_project() to spin up a
    project in seconds.
